WEBVTT

6.1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:09.850
You don't always need to fill in the table. You can answer a request by sending us a photo, a message or a voice note in chat.

6.2
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.875
Printed the request? Tick the boxes at the yard, snap a photo, and send it to us.

6.3
00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:22.008
The request number printed on the sheet tells us which job it's for.

6.4
00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:28.692
Or just type it. For example: Barton Hills, everything's available except the red yucca.

6.5
00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:32.808
Or tap the microphone and say it.

6.6
00:00:42.867 --> 00:00:46.392
We'll check what you've sent and update the request for you.

6.7
00:00:46.867 --> 00:00:51.767
Your answers then show up in the portal, just as if you'd entered them yourself.

6.8
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.225
If anything's unclear, we'll ask you in chat.
